6	2026-04-23 18:13:43.010995+00	2026-04-23 18:13:43.011029+00	dangngochuy20051120@gmail.com	[JobPortal] Mã xác thực đặt lại mật khẩu	<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang="vi">\n\n<head>\n    <meta charset="UTF-8">\n    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">\n    <title>Mã xác thực OTP</title>\n    <style>\n        /* Reset & Base */\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\n            background-color: #F8FAFC;\n            /* Slate 50 - Lighter, cooler gray */\n            margin: 0;\n            padding: 0;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n            color: #334155;\n            /* Slate 700 */\n            line-height: 1.6;\n        }\n\n        /* Container */\n        .wrapper {\n            width: 100%;\n            background-color: #F8FAFC;\n            padding: 40px 0;\n        }\n\n        .container {\n            max-width: 600px;\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n            border-radius: 16px;\n            /* More rounded */\n            overflow: hidden;\n            /* Glass-like soft shadow */\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 40px -10px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.15);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(226, 232, 240, 0.8);\n        }\n\n        /* Crystal Glass Header */\n        .header {\n            /* "Mirror Blue" Gradient: Deep Blue to Bright Cyan */\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1E3A8A 0%, #3B82F6 50%, #60A5FA 100%);\n            padding: 45px 40px 35px;\n            text-align: center;\n            /* Subtle inner shine for glass effect */\n            box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n            position: relative;\n            overflow: hidden;\n        }\n\n        .logo {\n            font-size: 30px;\n            font-weight: 800;\n            color: #FFFFFF !important;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            letter-spacing: 1px;\n            text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n            /* Deep shadow text */\n            font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n            text-transform: uppercase;\n        }\n\n        /* Content */\n        .content {\n            padding: 40px;\n            background-color: #FFFFFF;\n        }\n\n        h1,\n        h2,\n        h3 {\n            margin-top: 0;\n            color: #0F172A;\n            /* Slate 900 */\n            letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n        }\n\n        p {\n            margin-bottom: 24px;\n            color: #475569;\n            /* Slate 600 */\n            font-size: 16px;\n        }\n\n        /* Glass Button V3 */\n        .btn {\n            display: inline-block;\n            /* Matching Blue Gradient */\n            background: linear-gradient(to right, #2563EB, #0EA5E9);\n            color: #FFFFFF !important;\n            font-weight: 700;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            padding: 14px 40px;\n            border-radius: 50px;\n            text-align: center;\n            margin: 15px 0 35px;\n            /* Glossy reflection shadow */\n            box-shadow: 0 10px 20px -10px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.5), inset 0 2px 0 rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);\n        }\n\n        .btn:hover {\n            transform: translateY(-1px);\n            box-shadow: 0 6px 8px -1px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);\n        }\n\n        .divider {\n            height: 1px;\n            background: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, #E2E8F0, transparent);\n            margin: 30px 0;\n            border: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Glass Highlight Box */\n        .highlight-box {\n            background-color: #F8FAFC;\n            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;\n            border-radius: 12px;\n            padding: 24px;\n            margin: 24px 0;\n            /* Subtle inner shadow for depth */\n            box-shadow: inset 0 2px 4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);\n        }\n\n        /* Footer */\n        .footer {\n            background-color: #F1F5F9;\n            /* Slate 100 */\n            padding: 30px 40px;\n            text-align: center;\n            font-size: 13px;\n            color: #94A3B8;\n            /* Slate 400 */\n            border-top: 1px solid #E2E8F0;\n        }\n\n        .footer a {\n            color: #6366F1;\n            text-decoration: none;\n            font-weight: 500;\n        }\n\n        /* Helper for centered text blocks */\n        .text-center {\n            text-align: center;\n        }\n\n        /* Responsive */\n        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {\n            .content {\n                padding: 24px;\n            }\n\n            .header {\n                padding: 30px 24px;\n            }\n\n            .btn {\n                width: 100%;\n                box-sizing: border-box;\n            }\n        }\n    </style>\n    \n</head>\n\n<body>\n    <div class="wrapper">\n        <div class="container">\n            <div class="header">\n                <a href="http://localhost:3000" class="logo">JobPortal</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="content">\n                \n<div style="text-align: center;">\n    <h2>Xác thực tài khoản</h2>\n    <p>Xin chào <strong>Đặng Ngọc Huy</strong>,</p>\n    <p>Đây là mã xác thực (OTP) để đặt lại mật khẩu của bạn. Mã này có hiệu lực trong <strong>10\n            phút</strong>.</p>\n\n    <div\n        style="background-color: #EEF2FF; border: 2px dashed #4F46E5; border-radius: 12px; padding: 24px; margin: 32px 0; display: inline-block; min-width: 200px;">\n        <span style="font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 8px; color: #4F46E5; display: block;">{{\n            otp_code }}</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <p style="color: #6B7280; font-size: 14px;">Nếu bạn không yêu cầu mã này, vui lòng bỏ qua email.</p>\n</div>\n\n            </div>\n\n            <div class="footer">\n                <p style="margin: 0 0 10px;">&copy; 2026 JobPortal. All rights reserved.</p>\n                <div style="margin-bottom: 10px;">\n                    <a href="#" style="margin: 0 8px;">Trang chủ</a> •\n                    <a href="#" style="margin: 0 8px;">Liên hệ</a> •\n                    <a href="#" style="margin: 0 8px;">Bảo mật</a>\n                </div>\n                <p style="margin: 0;">Email này được gửi tự động. Vui lòng không trả lời.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</body>\n\n</html>	sent		\N
